sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff
    participant R as Routers<br/>+ Auth
    participant P as Prompt Builder<br/>+ LLM Gateway
    participant X as LLM<br/>Provider
    participant Q as SQL<br/>Guard
    participant E as Read-only<br/>Executor
    participant A as Answer<br/>Builder
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    Note over S,R: "How many unique Biological<br/>Sciences students came to a<br/>Bagel Breakfast in Fall 2026?"
    S->>R: POST /api/chat
    R->>R: Check login
    R->>P: Question
    P->>D: Read controlled values (schools, events, types, terms)
    P->>X: Question + view<br/>description only
    X-->>P: JSON: SQL,<br/>interpretation,<br/>assumptions
    P->>Q: Reply passed<br/>Pydantic check
    alt Not one SELECT on attendance_view
        Q-->>P: Refused,<br/>reason only
        Note over P,X: One retry with the<br/>reason, then "cannot<br/>answer safely"
    else Approved
        Q->>E: SQL +<br/>LIMIT
        E->>D: As chatbot_ro:<br/>read-only, timeout
        D-->>E: Rows (stay on<br/>this computer)
        E->>A: Rows
        A->>D: Query log
        A-->>S: "6 unique students" + table + interpretation + SQL
    end
    S->>R: GET /api/exports/{id}.xlsx
    R->>E: Re-run the logged SQL
    E-->>R: Rows
    Note over R: Export Service:<br/>= + - @ values<br/>saved as text
    R-->>S: .xlsx file
